# mail-sentinel: read Dovecot/Exim logs every 15 minutes and email anomalies.
#
# The job prepares everything, cron only calls it. No MAILTO here on purpose:
# cron already mails the job owner, root, and where root's mail goes is the
# box's business, not this project's. Failures write to stderr, which is what
# cron mails on, and the wrapper reports the exit code to the heartbeat monitor
# when one is configured. See docs/install.md.
PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin
*/15 * * * * root /opt/mail-sentinel/scripts/run-cycle.sh
